```bash cURL
curl -X POST "https://api.lemondata.cc/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-pro:generateContent?key=sk-your-api-key" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "contents": [
      {
        "parts": [{"text": "Hello, Gemini!"}]
      }
    ],
    "generationConfig": {
      "temperature": 0.7,
      "maxOutputTokens": 1024
    }
  }'
```

```python Python
