      "owned_by": "openai"
    },
    {
      "id": "claude-sonnet-4-5",
      "object": "model",
      "created": 1706000000,
      "owned_by": "anthropic"
    },
    {
      "id": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "object": "model",
      "created": 1706000000,
      "owned_by": "google"
    }
  ]
}
```
</ResponseExample>

## プロバイダーによるフィルタリング

```python
